<title>USA: MBIA qualifies six muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies six muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Terrebonne Parish, La., $3.5 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Pittsfield, Mass., $8.7 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Ontonagon Area Schools, Mich., $3.755 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Waveland, Miss., $1.2 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Florida Union Free School District, N.Y., $8.2 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Superior, Wis., $3.325 million GO notes.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
